OL,3,CTwelve people killed as tourist bus
OL,4,Ccrashes in Hungary
OL,6,FA bus crash in Hungary has left 12
OL,7,Fpeople dead and at least 10 others
OL,8,Finjured, police have said.
OL,10,FThe bus was carrying a group of Polish
OL,11,Ftourists on a highway when it went off
OL,12,Fthe road early on Sunday and into a
OL,13,Fditch where it overturned.
OL,15,FIn a statement, police said it was
OL,16,Flikely that the driver fell asleep at
OL,17,Fthe wheel, adding that they had been
OL,18,Ftaken into custody.
