OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786906081
OL,3,CTwelve people killed as tourist bus
OL,4,Ccrashes in Hungary
OL,6,FThe bus was traveling eastbound near
OL,7,Fthe town of Mezokeresztes when it
OL,8,Foverturned around 87 miles east of
OL,9,FHungary's capital, Budapest, at around
OL,10,F1am.
OL,12,FHungary's National Directorate for
OL,13,FDisaster Management said in a
OL,14,Fstatement that 57 passengers and two
OL,15,Fdrivers were traveling on the bus at
OL,16,Fthe time of the accident, and that
OL,17,Fseveral of the passengers had been
OL,18,Ftrapped under the vehicle when it
OL,19,Foverturned.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
