PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786906081
OL,3,CTwelve people killed as tourist bus
OL,4,Ccrashes in Hungary
OL,6,FPolish Foreign Ministry spokesperson
OL,7,FMaciej Wewior told Polish news agency
OL,8,FPAP on Sunday that all of the people
OL,9,Fon the bus were Polish citizens.
OL,11,FThe bus was carrying people from
OL,12,FPoland's southeastern Podkarpackie
OL,13,Fregion who were returning from a
OL,14,Fpilgrimage in Bosnia-Herzegovina, the
OL,15,Fregional government in Rzeszow,
OL,16,FPoland, said in a Facebook post.
OL,18,FHungarian Prime Minister Peter Magyar
OL,19,Fwrote in a statement on Facebook that
OL,20,Fat least 10 people were seriously
OL,21,Finjured in the crash.
