OL,3,CTwelve people killed as tourist bus
OL,4,Ccrashes in Hungary
OL,6,FHe offered his condolences to the
OL,7,Ffamilies of the victims and thanked
OL,8,Frescue workers who were dispatched to
OL,9,Fthe scene.
OL,11,FPolish President Karol Nawrocki
OL,12,Fexpressed his "deep sorrow" over the
OL,13,Faccident, writing in a post on X: "I
OL,14,Fjoin the families and loved ones of
OL,15,Fthe victims in prayer and deep
OL,16,Fsympathy."
